  "details": "When I'm typing using a keyboard (say in the chat window, searching, etc), my left trigger was registering an input (typing a letter it points at) both when the trigger is pressed, and also when it is released. \n\nI'm guessing this has to do with my custom steam binding I have where a double left trigger click input activates the personal mirror - because the right stick has no such issue, and when I return to default bindings the left trigger works perfectly again as well.\n\nI'm using Valve Index, Valve Index \"knuckles\" controllers and I'm on SteamVR 2.81.",
